 "release": 0.2,
 "sustained": false,
 "notes": "Fender electric guitar (basic model), bridge pickup, recorded direct into an instrument input: completely dry, no amp, cab, EQ or effects (FreePats \"FSBS direct\" set; the FreePats \"clean\" set is the same recordings through an amp + stereo FX). 19 notes C2-C#6 (C2/D2 are drop-tuned low string), roughly every 2-4 semitones, natural sustain trimmed to 5 s. Intended as the dry source for the engine's amp/cab simulation: for Clean use a clean amp + 4x12/1x12 cab EQ (HPF ~80 Hz, LPF ~5-6 kHz); Jazz = neck-ish darker EQ; Crunch/Drive = waveshaper before the cab. Recommended release 0.15-0.25 s.",
 "sampleRate": 44100
}
